    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>    一隻帶着惡意的眼睛從黑暗中窺視，其內閃爍着怪異的智慧和人的殘暴。大多數時候，諾斯異怪滿足於觀察、掂量和評估它所遇到的生物。而當被逼至使用暴力時，它們會用其駭人的凝視將敵人的血肉從骨頭上腐化剝落。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">    <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>被詛咒的奧術師Cursed Arcanists。</strong></em>強大的巫妖維克那Vecna，在某些世界裏已經超越其不死存在而成爲掌管祕密神職的神靈。它遺下的某個黑暗詛咒影響着那些放棄淬鍊自己近神之力轉而獻身於發掘奧術祕密的法師，使其退化爲佝僂而嫉恨的怪物。諾斯異怪失去了所有從前的自我意識，它們在黑暗中摸索藏匿，徘徊在那些充滿魔法知識之地，受困於曾經源於自己而現在已經無法理解的記憶與衝動之中。</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">    <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>黑暗神諭Dark Oracles。</strong></em>諾斯異怪擁有一種怪異的魔法洞察力，得以讓其從其他生物身上提取知識。這種能力令它們對祕密和禁忌學識有着獨特的理解，而它們也會以一定的代價給別人分享這些知識。諾斯異怪貪求魔法物品，同樣也貪求那些前來尋求其知識的生物贈予的禮物。</p></div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">   <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>魔法之地的潛入者Lurkers in Magical Places。</strong></em>諾斯異怪因時常潛入奧法研究院和其他大量研習魔法的場所而臭名昭著。它們模糊的認知到這些地方保存着某些能夠逆轉自己當前狀況的相關情報。它們並沒有明確的目標，只是其意識深處有一份驅使其行動的執念。只是仍有一部分諾斯異怪可以足夠聰明的認識到這樣的行爲與其當初受教訓時毫無差別，只是另一個驅使其尋找更多奧術祕密的虛假希望。</p><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>A baleful eye peers out from the darkness, its gleam hinting at a weird intelligence and unnerving malevolence. Most times, a nothic is content to watch, weighing and assessing the creatures it encounters. When driven to violence, it uses its horrific gaze to rot the flesh from its enemies' bones.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Cursed Arcanists\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Cursed Arcanists.</span> Rather than gaining the godlike supremacy they crave, some wizards who devote their lives to unearthing arcane secrets are reduced to creeping, tormented monsters by a dark curse left behind by Vecna, a powerful lich who, in some worlds, has transcended his undead existence to become a god of secrets. Nothics retain no awareness of their former selves, skulking amid the shadows and haunting places rich in magical knowledge, drawn by memories and impulses they can't quite understand.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dark Oracles\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dark Oracles.</span> Nothics possess a strange magical insight that allows them to extract knowledge from other creatures. This grants them unique understanding of secret and forbidden lore, which they share for a price. A nothic covets magic items, greedily accepting such gifts from creatures that seek out its knowledge.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Lurkers in Magical Places\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Lurkers in Magical Places.</span> Nothics are notorious for infiltrating arcane academies and other places rich in magical learning. They are driven by the vague knowledge that there exists a method to reverse their condition. This isn't a clear sense of purpose, but rather an obsessive tug at the end of the mind. Some nothics are clever enough to realize that this is merely part of the strange lesson for their folly, a false hope to drive them to seek out more arcane secrets.</p></div></div></div></div>",
