    {
      "_id": "QPBilNH12tn5ZE18",
      "name": "怪異洞悉Weird Insight",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "236",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>諾斯異怪指定其周邊30尺內一個它能看到的生物。該目標必須以其魅力（&amp;Reference[skill=Deception]{欺瞞}）檢定對抗該諾斯異怪的感知（&amp;Reference[skill=Insight]{洞悉}）檢定。如果諾斯異怪勝出，則它以魔法得知一件與目標相關的事實或祕密。如果目標免疫&amp;Reference[condition=charmed]{魅惑}，則它將在該檢定對抗中直接勝出。<br />The nothic targets one creature it can see within 30 feet of it. The target must contest its Charisma (&amp;Reference[skill=Deception]) check against the nothic's Wisdom (&amp;Reference[skill=Insight]) check. If the nothic wins, it magically learns one fact or secret about the target. The target automatically wins if it is immune to being &amp;Reference[condition=charmed].</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
